adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte (2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package everything the port needs that was installed by hand:
    - udev rules from the Android ueventd files (binder, ion, hwcomposer
      nodes; without them there is no Plasma screen) and the vibrator rule,
    - PulseAudio droid card options for the Samsung audio HAL (no
      create_audio_patch; pulseaudio crashed at start without them),
    - boot splash theme debian-s10, the same frame S-Boot leaves on the
      panel, set as the default theme,
    - automatic screen brightness and the CPU touch boost service,
    - the KDE portal user unit only for Wayland sessions,
    - new adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte-tools: plasma_session and
      ksplashqml with the Droidian KDE_NO_KWIN patches (package diversion
      replaces the earlier local one) and the podglad wayfire plugin.
  * Files installed by hand before are taken over and the old copies
    removed when they match the packaged ones.

 -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:00:00 +0200

